{"seq":1,"slug":"error-design","title":"错误设计与状态码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/error-design","wordCount":1106,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"错误设计与状态码\">错误设计与状态码</h1><p>当 API 返回 <code>500 Internal Server Error</code> 加一句 &quot;Something went wrong&quot; 时，开发者只能盲猜问题出在哪。一个好的错误响应应该回答三个问题：<strong>出了什么错</strong>（机器可解析的错误码）、<strong>为什么错</strong>（人可读的说明）、<strong>怎么修</strong>（可行动的指引）。错误设计是 API 开发者体验的基石——它决定了消费者在遇到问题时是 5 分钟修好还是 5 小时排查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>HTTP 状态码是错误分类的第一层信号，错误响应体是第二层详情。两者配合才构成完整的错误通信。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[请求失败] --&gt; B{状态码分类}&#10;    B --&gt; C[4xx 客户端错误]&#10;    B --&gt; D[5xx 服务端错误]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[400 Bad Request]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[401 Unauthorized]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[403 Forbidden]&#10;    C --&gt; C4[404 Not Found]&#10;    C --&gt; C5[422 Validation Error]&#10;    C --&gt; C6[429 Rate Limited]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[500 Internal Error]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[502 Bad Gateway]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[503 Unavailable]\">graph TB\n    A[请求失败] --&gt; B{状态码分类}\n    B --&gt; C[4xx 客户端错误]\n    B --&gt; D[5xx 服务端错误]\n    C --&gt; C1[400 Bad Request]\n    C --&gt; C2[401 Unauthorized]\n    C --&gt; C3[403 Forbidden]\n    C --&gt; C4[404 Not Found]\n    C --&gt; C5[422 Validation Error]\n    C --&gt; C6[429 Rate Limited]\n    D --&gt; D1[500 Internal Error]\n    D --&gt; D2[502 Bad Gateway]\n    D --&gt; D3[503 Unavailable]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态码</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>何时使用</th>\n<th>可重试?</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>400</td>\n<td>请求格式错误</td>\n<td>JSON 语法错、缺必需字段</td>\n<td>否（修正请求后可重发）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>401</td>\n<td>未认证</td>\n<td>Token 缺失或过期</td>\n<td>是（刷新 Token 后）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>403</td>\n<td>无权限</td>\n<td>已认证但权限不足</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>404</td>\n<td>资源不存在</td>\n<td>ID 无效或已删除</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>409</td>\n<td>冲突</td>\n<td>乐观锁冲突、唯一约束违反</td>\n<td>是（获取最新状态后）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>422</td>\n<td>业务校验失败</td>\n<td>JSON 格式正确但值不合法</td>\n<td>否（修正值后可重发）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>429</td>\n<td>限流</td>\n<td>超出速率限制</td>\n<td>是（尊重 Retry-After）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>500</td>\n<td>服务器错误</td>\n<td>未捕获异常</td>\n<td>谨慎（可能是 bug）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>503</td>\n<td>服务不可用</td>\n<td>维护或过载</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"400-vs-422-的分界线\">400 vs 422 的分界线</h2><p>这是 API 设计中最常见的争议之一：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>400 Bad Request</strong> — 请求本身就&quot;坏了&quot;：JSON 解析失败、Content-Type 不匹配、缺少必需的 HTTP 头部</li>\n<li><strong>422 Unprocessable Entity</strong> — 请求格式正确（JSON 合法），但<strong>业务规则不允许</strong>：邮箱格式无效、金额为负数、状态转移不合法</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// 400 — 请求格式错误&#10;{&#10;  &quot;error&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;code&quot;: &quot;PARSE_ERROR&quot;,&#10;    &quot;message&quot;: &quot;Request body is not valid JSON&quot;,&#10;    &quot;details&quot;: &quot;Unexpected token &#39;}&#39; at position 42&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 422 — 业务校验失败&#10;{&#10;  &quot;error&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;code&quot;: &quot;VALIDATION_ERROR&quot;,&#10;    &quot;message&quot;: &quot;Request body failed validation&quot;,&#10;    &quot;details&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;email&quot;, &quot;message&quot;: &quot;must be a valid email address&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;age&quot;, &quot;message&quot;: &quot;must be at least 18&quot; }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 400 — 请求格式错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PARSE_ERROR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Request body is not valid JSON\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"details\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Unexpected token '}' at position 42\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 422 — 业务校验失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VALIDATION_ERROR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Request body failed validation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"details\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"must be a valid email address\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"must be at least 18\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"标准化错误响应结构\">标准化错误响应结构</h2><p>统一的错误信封让客户端用同一段解析逻辑处理所有错误。推荐结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;error&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;code&quot;: &quot;RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND&quot;,&#10;    &quot;message&quot;: &quot;Order with ID ord_xyz does not exist&quot;,&#10;    &quot;details&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;field&quot;: &quot;order_id&quot;,&#10;        &quot;message&quot;: &quot;No order found with this identifier&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;request_id&quot;: &quot;req_8a3b1c5a&quot;,&#10;    &quot;documentation_url&quot;: &quot;https://docs.api.com/errors/RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Order with ID ord_xyz does not exist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"details\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"No order found with this identifier\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"request_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"req_8a3b1c5a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"documentation_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://docs.api.com/errors/RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"各字段的设计意图\">各字段的设计意图</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>面向</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>code</code></td>\n<td>字符串常量</td>\n<td>机器</td>\n<td>客户端 switch/case 路由错误处理逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>message</code></td>\n<td>人可读文本</td>\n<td>开发者</td>\n<td>快速理解问题，可直接展示在调试工具中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>details</code></td>\n<td>数组</td>\n<td>两者</td>\n<td>字段级错误定位，支持表单校验展示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>request_id</code></td>\n<td>唯一标识</td>\n<td>运维</td>\n<td>跨系统追踪同一请求的日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>documentation_url</code></td>\n<td>URL</td>\n<td>开发者</td>\n<td>直达该错误的修复文档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"错误码的设计模式\">错误码的设计模式</h3><p>错误码应该是<strong>稳定的字符串常量</strong>（不是数字），用 <code>UPPER_SNAKE_CASE</code> 命名，具有层次结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"AUTH_TOKEN_EXPIRED      — 认证相关&#10;AUTH_INSUFFICIENT_SCOPE&#10;VALIDATION_REQUIRED_FIELD&#10;VALIDATION_INVALID_FORMAT&#10;RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND&#10;RESOURCE_ALREADY_EXISTS&#10;RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED&#10;INTERNAL_SERVICE_ERROR\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>AUTH_TOKEN_EXPIRED      — 认证相关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>AUTH_INSUFFICIENT_SCOPE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>VALIDATION_REQUIRED_FIELD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>VALIDATION_INVALID_FORMAT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RESOURCE_ALREADY_EXISTS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>INTERNAL_SERVICE_ERROR</span></span></code></pre></div><p>数字错误码（如 <code>10042</code>）对开发者来说是不透明的，必须查文档才能理解含义。字符串错误码自描述且 grep 友好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部分成功-partial-failure-的处理\">部分成功（Partial Failure）的处理</h2><p>批量操作中可能部分成功部分失败。两种常见模式：</p>\n<p><strong>模式 1：全部或全部不</strong> — 任何一条失败则整个请求回滚，返回 422 + 所有失败详情</p>\n<p><strong>模式 2：部分成功</strong> — 返回 207 Multi-Status，列出每条的结果</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;results&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;item_1&quot;, &quot;status&quot;: 201, &quot;data&quot;: { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;created_1&quot; } },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;item_2&quot;, &quot;status&quot;: 422, &quot;error&quot;: { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;VALIDATION_ERROR&quot;, &quot;message&quot;: &quot;...&quot; } },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;item_3&quot;, &quot;status&quot;: 201, &quot;data&quot;: { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;created_3&quot; } }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;summary&quot;: { &quot;total&quot;: 3, &quot;succeeded&quot;: 2, &quot;failed&quot;: 1 }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"results\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"item_1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">201</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"created_1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"item_2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">422</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VALIDATION_ERROR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"item_3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">201</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"created_3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"summary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"succeeded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"failed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>选择哪种取决于业务语义：支付必须原子性（全部或全部不），批量导入可以接受部分成功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误响应中的安全考量\">错误响应中的安全考量</h2><p>错误信息不能泄露系统内部细节：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// 危险 — 暴露技术栈和内部结构&#10;{&#10;  &quot;error&quot;: &quot;PostgreSQL error: relation &#39;users&#39; does not exist&quot;,&#10;  &quot;stack&quot;: &quot;at UserRepository.findById (src/repos/user.ts:42)&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 安全 — 对外只暴露业务语义&#10;{&#10;  &quot;error&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;code&quot;: &quot;INTERNAL_SERVICE_ERROR&quot;,&#10;    &quot;message&quot;: &quot;An unexpected error occurred. Please try again later.&quot;,&#10;    &quot;request_id&quot;: &quot;req_abc123&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 危险 — 暴露技术栈和内部结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PostgreSQL error: relation 'users' does not exist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"stack\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"at UserRepository.findById (src/repos/user.ts:42)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 安全 — 对外只暴露业务语义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INTERNAL_SERVICE_ERROR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"An unexpected error occurred. Please try again later.\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"request_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"req_abc123\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>5xx 错误绝不暴露堆栈、SQL、内部路径</li>\n<li>404 不要区分&quot;资源不存在&quot;和&quot;无权访问该资源&quot;（防止枚举攻击）</li>\n<li>认证错误不要透露&quot;用户不存在&quot;还是&quot;密码错误&quot;（防止用户枚举）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"错误文档与错误目录\">错误文档与错误目录</h2><p>成熟的 API 为每个错误码维护一份文档页，通过 <code>documentation_url</code> 直链。Stripe 和 GitHub 的错误目录是业界标杆：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个错误码一页</li>\n<li>列出可能的原因</li>\n<li>给出具体的修复步骤</li>\n<li>提供相关 API 端点的链接</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这让开发者从&quot;看到错误&quot;到&quot;修复问题&quot;的路径最短化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>HTTP 状态码是第一层分类信号：4xx 客户端可修、5xx 服务端问题</li>\n<li>400（格式错）vs 422（业务校验失败）有清晰分界线</li>\n<li>统一错误信封包含 code（机器用）+ message（人用）+ details（定位）+ request_id（追踪）</li>\n<li>错误码用 UPPER_SNAKE_CASE 字符串常量，自描述且稳定</li>\n<li>5xx 错误绝不暴露内部细节，404 不区分&quot;不存在&quot;和&quot;无权&quot;以防枚举攻击</li>\n<li>每个错误码维护文档页，让开发者从报错到修复路径最短</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../patterns/authentication-authorization\">认证与授权模式</a> — 401/403 错误背后的认证授权设计</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../frontend/frontend-error-handling/foundations/why-error-handling\">前端错误处理</a> — 前端如何消费和展示 API 错误</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"错误设计与状态码","id":"错误设计与状态码"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"400 vs 422 的分界线","id":"400-vs-422-的分界线"},{"level":2,"text":"标准化错误响应结构","id":"标准化错误响应结构"},{"level":3,"text":"各字段的设计意图","id":"各字段的设计意图"},{"level":3,"text":"错误码的设计模式","id":"错误码的设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"部分成功（Partial Failure）的处理","id":"部分成功-partial-failure-的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"错误响应中的安全考量","id":"错误响应中的安全考量"},{"level":2,"text":"错误文档与错误目录","id":"错误文档与错误目录"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"认证与授权模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/patterns/authentication-authorization"},"next":{"title":"文档生成与 SDK 工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/docs-sdk-generation"}}